{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】美國總統特朗普談及美中俄三國在和平宣言中，一致認為國際刑事法院以及其他類似機構不得濫用管轄權。</p>\n<p>美國總統特朗普：「中國也首次同意譴責國際刑事法院濫權及越權，它已經失控，我想說普京尤其不滿，但其他人也同樣不滿。」</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:24:12.537931+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:13:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:17:47.376638+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:17:47.376638+00:00","content_hash":"0432e3cb2c471dfb41a0674f93861ad9ae3833ad7d4cf3557566bdb73a8043a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}